- valuetype is boolean.
- logic is "Low BMI Follow-up Service Requests" justified by "Underweight Diagnoses".

concept "Has Underweight On Or Before Low BMI Follow-up Order":
- type is Observation.
- valuetype is boolean.
- logic is "Has Underweight" on or before "Low BMI Follow-up Order Date".

concept "Low BMI Follow-up Order Date During MP":
